{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26000","headline":"巫山怀古 · 鲍溶","name":"巫山怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十二峯峦鬬翠微，石烟花雾犯容辉。\n青春楚女妒云老，白日神人入梦稀。\n银箭暗凋歌夜烛，珠泉频点舞时衣。\n谁伤宋玉千年後，留得青山辨是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}